        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, third parties may have, or may obtain, blocking patents of which we are currently unaware that could be used to prevent us from developing or commercializing our product candidates and practicing our proprietary technology.",
        "start_character": 38199,
        "end_character": 38435
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-095014",
