        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-095014",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our rezatapopt program, we are focused on developing a pipeline of product candidates targeting other p53 mutations or p53-related targets.",
        "start_character": 25164,
        "end_character": 25318
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-095014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-095014-68f1ef3d46af04fd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-095014",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we will likely need to develop our product candidates in collaboration with companion diagnostic companies, and we will face competition from other companies in establishing these collaborations.",
        "start_character": 28331,
        "end_character": 28539
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-095014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-095014-68f1ef3d46af04fd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-095014",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Subject to receiving marketing approvals, we expect to commence commercialization activities by building a focused sales and marketing organization to sell our products.",
        "start_character": 32593,
        "end_character": 32762
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-095014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-095014-68f1ef3d46af04fd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-095014",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also plan to build a marketing and sales management organization to create and implement marketing strategies for any products that we market through our own sales organization and to oversee and support our sales force.",
